[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    164[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // representation of `house_t` and returns 0. The cases below cover both sides
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    165[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // of that decision plus the numeric edges of the conversion.
